<title>USA: D&amp;N Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>D&amp;N Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	$ 0.13   profit	 $0.39</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,085   profit	 3,058</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 results include one-time charges related to the FDIC Savings Association Insurance Fund of $3.6 million after taxes and $500,000 related to legislation changing the taxation rules covering thrifts' reserves for losses on loans. Excluding the one-time charges, 1996 Q3 earnings were $3.0 million or $0.36/shr fully diluted.  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary profit     $0.71   profit	 $0.92</p>
<p> Net profit		 5,764   profit	 7,071</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,587		    7,429</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Assets $1.41 billion vs $1.23 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $944.7 million vs $922.9 million</p>
<p>Net loans $1.09 billion vs $952.4 million</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 nine-month shr diluted profit was $0.90.</p>
<p>Excluding one-time charges, 1996 nine-month earnings were $9.8 million or $1.20/shr.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
